      "body_text": "窓を開けたとたんに小鳥が外へ逃げてしまった。 \n\n\t\tThe small bird has run away to the outside as soon as having opened the window.",
      "body_html": "<a href=\"http://www.csse.monash.edu.au/~jwb/cgi-bin/wwwjdic.cgi?9MHJ窓を開けたとたんに小鳥が外へ逃げてしまった。\">\n\t\t\t\t窓を開け<strong>たとたん</strong>に小鳥が外へ逃げてしまった。<strong></strong></a> <br/>\n\t\tThe small bird has run away to the outside as soon as having opened the window. \n\t\t<strong> </strong>",
