      "body_html": "<a href=\"http://www.csse.monash.edu.au/~jwb/cgi-bin/wwwjdic.cgi?9MHJ帰宅したとたん雨が降り始めた。\">\n\t\t\t\t帰宅し<strong>たとたん</strong>雨が降り始めた。\r<strong></strong></a> <br/>\n\t\tEven as I came home, it began to rain. \n\t\t<strong> </strong>",
